      {
        "name": "places/ChIJgx3UxQQBBDQRxdtcv9bMQlo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKMlkzTkJWRjlLZUc5UE5VODFNRXRPY1hoU1RWRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 個月前",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": {
          "text": "2026/08/02\nD朋友話食物質素一般，CP值低過返深圳D餐廳。\n我都覺得食物無以前係北角果時好食，唔怪之得無爆場，食完走都仲有吉檯。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
